cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use VintageBench, please cite it as below. Please also cite the data
  sources listed in data/NOTICE.md.
type: software
title: VintageBench
abstract: >-
  A benchmark testing whether AI analysts reason correctly about provisional
  data that is later revised, using US economic data vintages from ALFRED
  (Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis) as the first test bed.
authors:
  - family-names: Jyoti
    given-names: Divya
version: 0.0.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/divyajyoti-dev/vintagebench"
url: "https://github.com/divyajyoti-dev/vintagebench"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - large language models
  - data revisions
  - real-time data
  - ALFRED
  - economic data
